  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "83e15b0c-2f6c-ee4b-81ab-f6d966c01134"],
 " return the final block column in reverse layer order, beginning with its \
last diagonal block."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->747719097,ExpressionUUID->"70223ab6-8537-eb4e-82cf-805a62581a5f"],

Cell[TextData[{
